rally, assets should be recorded at their historical cost, which is the amount paid or the fair market value at the time of acquisition.</p>\r\n<p>Cost Principle: Generally, assets should be recorded at their historical cost, which is the amount paid or the fair market value at the time of acquisition.</p>', 0, 100, 383, 1, 1, '2023-08-01 11:21:26', '0', NULL, '0'),
